{
  "id": "wbx-prj-pop-all-s1-fe",
  "title": "Wittgenstein Projection: Population in thousands by highest level of educational attainment. Incomplete Primary. Female",
  "category": "education",
  "icon": "🎓",
  "desc": "Total population in thousands that has pre-primary education or incomplete primary education as the highest level of educational attainment. Projections are based on collected census and survey data for the base year (around 2010) and the Medium Shared Socioeconomic Pathways (SSP2) projection model. The SSP2 is a middle-of-the-road scenario that combines medium fertility with medium mortality, medium migration, and the Global Education Trend (GET) education scenario. For more information and other projection models, consult the Wittgenstein Centre for Demography and Global Human Capital's website: http://www.oeaw.ac.at/vid/dataexplorer/",
  "unit": "indicator value",
